OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening with
OL,7,Fincreasing clear spells and light
OL,8,Fwinds. Staying dry overnight with
OL,9,Flengthy clear spells and becoming
OL,10,Fquite chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry and bright but somewhat
OL,13,Fchilly start. Sunshine turning hazy as
OL,14,Fcloud gradually spills east through
OL,15,Fthe afternoon ahead of rain in the
OL,16,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
