OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand patchy rain clearing east on
OL,7,FFriday morning. Then mostly dry with
OL,8,Fbright spells and just the odd shower
OL,9,Fand Friday and Saturday. Showery rain
OL,10,Fspreads east on Sunday.
